# ── Secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing in this project needs credentials today — the controller integration
# that did is dropped — but the guard stays, because the cost of it being here
# and unnecessary is nothing and the cost of it being absent once is permanent.
.env
*.pem
*.p12

# ── Swift and SwiftPM ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.build/
.swiftpm/
*.doccarchive

# Resolved dependency versions. This is a library: a consumer resolves its own graph,
# and the one remote dependency, swift-argument-parser, is pinned by a `from:` range
# that has never needed a lockfile to reproduce.
Package.resolved

# ── macOS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store

# Captured route-socket and NBSTAT fixtures are committed deliberately — see
# Tests/ZhenDarwinTests/Fixtures, and the header there explaining which are real
# captures and which are constructed. Nothing else binary belongs in the tree.
